  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc35:1.21.1": "I normally render <i lang='pi' translate='no'>pavārita</i> as “invited”, but the word also means “satisfied”. In the present case, the contextual meaning (see below) is that the monk has expressed his satisfaction after being invited to take more, thus “refused an invitation to eat more”. ",
